---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
---
<Site
  title="Preorder received — Muster Fleet Kit"
  description="Your Fleet Kit preorder is recorded. Delivery by 22 September 2026."
  path="/thanks"
  narrow
>
  <section style="padding:clamp(40px,7vw,72px) 0 0;">
    <div class="kicker" style="margin-bottom:16px;">receipt · recorded</div>
    <h1 style="font-size:clamp(25px,5.6vw,36px);line-height:1.18;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.015em;text-wrap:balance;">That's a preorder. Thank you.</h1>
    <p style="margin:20px 0 0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.8;text-wrap:pretty;">Your $99 is on the ledger, dated, and it moves the number in public. The kit lands in your inbox by 22 September. If it slips you will read it on the log the same day I know, which is the deal.</p>
    <p style="margin:16px 0 0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.8;text-wrap:pretty;">Nothing else is needed from you. Stripe has your receipt.</p>
    <div style="margin-top:28px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;">
      <a href="/challenge" class="btn-primary" style="flex:1 1 200px;">Watch the ledger</a>
      <a href="/log" class="btn-ghost" style="flex:1 1 200px;">Read the field notes</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Site>
